msgid ""
"The Cheerson CX-OF optical flow sensor is a lightweight and low cost optical"
" flow sensor which can be used to improve horizontal position control "
"especially in GPS denied environments."
msgstr "Cheerson CX-OF 光流传感器是一款轻便低成本的光流传感器，可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其适用于无 GPS 环境。"

