#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:30
#: 2d4c6244e5784e3987747a5dc081ddb3 4a5be48e79c9482380ed8d52d924a382
#: 4ed136d487884828893e2504e6cee74d 6f96dc58d45a4aa4861fdead9128cf06
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:36
#: 3b162e6660b84b7092fd8549765eaae1 46bef32e87c442d990c0840d601a4794
#: b62f5799e9fb43d08f43b697a2e9cab5 e1f071f6276247a081c0895517d4d9ea
msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the "
"camera lens pointing downwards.  The side of the sensor with the \"V2.0\" "
"label should be towards the front of the vehicle.  The image above is "
"incorrect because the autopilot's arrow is pointing down while the sensor's "
"\"V2.0\" label is close to the top."
msgstr ""
"光流传感器应安装在飞行器底部，摄像镜头朝下。传感器带有「V2.0」标签的一侧应朝向飞行器前方。上图有误，因为飞控箭头朝下，而传感器「V2.0」标签靠近顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:37
#: 32736ed319d748328e8086c4babbe8a7 ad84acb303aa4e96b24f915a0ef2839b
#: c4e480515bb54846bc01b04e9da5f2c5 e22c7159be2b463f993596e4096c8a4b
msgid ""
"Connect the sensor's TX and VSS (aka GND) pins to one of the autopilot's "
"serial ports.  In the image above the sensor is connected to a Pixhawk's "
"Telem2 port"
msgstr "将传感器的 TX 和 VSS（即 GND）引脚连接到飞控的某个串口。上图中传感器连接到 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:38
#: 2e62c6f9f26f4e34b69abc62f72576d0 4690b8aa8c4847428df0b97e4517b9c0
#: 8e24947aac44457e8140ea34bfaf59fc edd1c5bccd0c470c9e70f0071019a632
msgid ""
"Connect the sensor's VDD (aka VCC or 3.3V) to a 3.3V power source.  In the "
"above diagram the Pixhawk's Switch port is used but another alternative "
"would be the SPKT/DSM port's power pin"
msgstr ""
"将传感器的 VDD（即 VCC 或 3.3V）连接到 3.3V 电源。上图中使用的是 Pixhawk 的 Switch 接口，也可使用 SPKT/DSM"
" 接口的电源引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:40
#: 30b91c4b49d848d59ed37d11297c75da 9b75392f4cd24d178bde497ab068c099
#: cd7aebb41ad748a49acfe29201a9bde9 f48b17675bf547aaa09b47ae19597ba6
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 4"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:41
#: 00713e857d2e41ccae38cb54dea6c900 4a2e941e48654912b376a5263fdaec8d
#: 57887119723748dba3575bcc6723df28 71bce0e0ebb44a51a6ffc3781743b793
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 18 if using Serial2/Telem2,"
" if connected to another serial port use the corresponding SERIALx_PROTOCOL "
"parameter"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Serial2/Telem2，设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"18；如果连接到其他串口，使用相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:44
#: 09209b26d4934e7f9001470c051fc2e7 14169a67be894363abb1a156ecd9a9ce
#: 6e55cee4cb3d4d4a8c65057b1fd130c7 8b6195486c6d4bd2833bbe050f5936ef
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:46
#: 0a184984ac564bda9f884a62181eef23 167647da60f84777a60e42fd48338a87
#: 6a7bfe570d044777bc6cebbf4865273e 9b586f77fb5e458b8a8ae5416c08becc
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:47
#: 5402351514754d6fa414c34422ae2a61 a76ac66b926c4df387bbe04f744898bf
#: a82c07c913804986aa2975015ffc94b3 d8da1c7a2d1f4b62a13b6c41641faff9
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 模式无需使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:48
#: 0df3c8bb17c046e7950c05e6970a3211 2c342528f94f425d849e1f600de1c85d
#: 3191ed5b313743d289d3f5f98d3efbc6 ed5e672810394a56b72ea169b1d8b738
msgid "The sensor has been successfully tested to altitudes of about 40m"
msgstr "传感器已成功测试至约 40 米高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:49
#: 06f858365cd6408cb1deea21ada2c3c2 4e8d4d5530e344a5be915567c61d35eb
#: a0da6824013f4cfdb8e2770e0699579f fb47ac7eb0da440798a0cc6e475b5c32
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:52
#: 1cb062e77aa04e26bf0dca683d1abb94 52ba2a96a0754f37b4c922dc2bf540d0
#: 635cfcecb206425d9f9af863d1674d83 f2319523a99a4d789a612dbadf81e772
