msgid "See :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` for setup guides."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` 了解设置指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cheerson-cxof.rst:55
#: 23a2ba5ed60f4286a1e6bd016ba3be65 8f0095b08acb43f58d40839a87bd8b4a
#: b30ef0c3676b47bb97cc86a40d75b684 cd7abd5834cc4912aac1c6a86dc5e170
msgid ""
"Note that recommended value for :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` or "
":ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` for this sensor is 80."
msgstr ""
"请注意，此传感器 :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` 或 :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY "
"<EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` 的推荐值为 80。"

